{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own laid-back pixel city at your own pace. In this idle, stress-free city builder, you place buildings along a scenic road, collect bricks over time, and occasionally click on passing planes or balloons for bonus loot. No pressure, no losing, just a cozy, creative space to watch your town grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Idle Gameplay:</strong> Place buildings and let them generate bricks over time with no rush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, Charming Visuals:</strong> Colorful pixel art in a 2D side-view, with three different scenarios: city, countryside, and beach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Click Rewards:</strong> Click on passing objects like planes and balloons for extra brick bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purely Creative:</strong> No failure states, no stress \u2014 just build, decorate, and watch your little world come to life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951870?t=1755706689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951870?t=1755706689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/80cdd34bc893bf4e20734791621e1422c0e92c35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755706689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/80cdd34bc893bf4e20734791621e1422c0e92c35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755706689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own laid-back pixel city at your own pace. In this idle, stress-free city builder, you place buildings along a scenic road, collect bricks over time, a